   $q$Why is Deshawn's line "Safe inside, waiting for its big moment" funny to the audience?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Priya has whispered to Deshawn that the bottle is already empty.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The judge has told Deshawn that volcanoes cannot hold any lava.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Deshawn is joking because he knows the volcano will not erupt.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-character"},{"text":"The audience knows the lava is leaking out, so Deshawn is wrong.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The audience knows the lava is leaking out, so Deshawn is wrong.$q$, $q$The stage directions show the liquid leaking onto the floor, so the audience knows the "lava" is not safe inside at all. Deshawn is not joking; he truly believes everything is perfect.$q$, 'draft', '09c2cecc-2d16-5b5d-a6f0-982e0ae381ca')
