-- Passage rg7-story-details-inference-p02
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('be2fd60d-5a7e-5a39-ba5c-6f1106f82e2e', 'rg7-story-details-inference-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g7-story-details-inference'), null,
        '6-8', $q$The Rain Gauge$q$, $q$Every morning at seven, before his coffee,
my grandfather walked to the fence post by the garden
and read the glass tube clipped to its side.
He wrote the number in a green ledger
whose pages had gone soft as cloth.

Forty-one years of mornings, he told me once.
Wet springs, dry Augusts, the winter it snowed in April.
He never said why it mattered.
He only tapped the ledger and said, "Somebody has to remember."

This year his knees keep him on the porch.
So I walk the wet grass at seven instead,
squinting at the thin blue line,
and I call the number back to him.
He writes it down slowly, in pencil now,
and asks me to say it twice.

Yesterday the tube was empty.
I almost didn't bother to call out.
Then I remembered the ledger,
the dry Augusts lined up in his handwriting,
and I shouted, "Zero, Grandpa. Zero."
He wrote that down, too.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
