   $q$What does the reed floating away at the end most likely represent?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Tamsin giving up on fishing because the marsh has dried out.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Tamsin's anger at the egret for asking her a hard question.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The marsh starting to fill with water again after the drought.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Tamsin letting go of her habit of comparing herself to others.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Tamsin letting go of her habit of comparing herself to others.$q$, $q$The reed is the tool Tamsin used to compare herself, so dropping it shows she is done comparing. She has just caught many fish, so she is not giving up on fishing.$q$, 'draft', '05118b28-a66c-5255-ad20-ee042c6532b9')
