   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Jalen ruins the district relay for his whole team and should have been much more careful.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Jalen drops the baton again at regionals but still wins the race for Riverside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Coach Ferreira hands Jalen a timing sheet while he sits behind the scoreboard.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"After dropping the baton at districts, Jalen sees he ran well afterward, practices handoffs, and runs cleanly at regionals.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$After dropping the baton at districts, Jalen sees he ran well afterward, practices handoffs, and runs cleanly at regionals.$q$, $q$The correct choice covers the mistake, the coach's lesson, the practice and the clean handoff without judgment. Saying Jalen "should have been more careful" is an opinion.$q$, 'draft', 'c0a98cc7-05e4-5ea8-944a-280e23b2f42e')
