   $q$How does the coach's line, "A dropped baton is one second. What you did after it was the other eleven," help develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It tells Jalen that the drop did not change the team's finish.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It explains the official rules for timing a relay race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It shows that the coach is angry that Jalen skipped the ceremony.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It helps Jalen see his whole race instead of only the mistake.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It helps Jalen see his whole race instead of only the mistake.$q$, $q$The coach points out that the mistake was only a small part of a strong race, and Jalen then notices "the rest of his own race." The drop did cost the team, since Riverside fell from first to fourth.$q$, 'draft', 'c0a98cc7-05e4-5ea8-944a-280e23b2f42e')
