   $q$What does the author want the school to do?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Let students design and paint a mural in the hallway.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Hire a professional artist to paint the cafeteria.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Repaint every wall in the building a brighter color.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Display more student artwork in folders at home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Let students design and paint a mural in the hallway.$q$, $q$The author says "our school should let students design and paint a mural there." The whole point is a student-made mural, not one by a hired professional.$q$, 'draft', 'c15ebd96-1aae-53fe-acf0-d34296bc990a')
