   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this article?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To teach readers how beavers cut down trees with their teeth.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"},{"text":"To inform readers about both sides of a debate over beavers.","is_correct":true},{"text":"To persuade readers that beavers must be returned at once.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"assumes-persuasive"},{"text":"To persuade readers that beavers should stay out forever.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"assumes-persuasive"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To inform readers about both sides of a debate over beavers.$q$, $q$The author says "both sides raise points worth understanding" and explains each one without choosing. The article never argues that beavers must or must not return.$q$, 'draft', '0df2b23f-b3fc-5e43-9638-023cf1e77b6a')
